msgctxt "80"
msgid "Damn... What kind of monster are you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Game's over. Give it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hmph! Take your hostages and get the fuck outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Did you forget? You're coming with me, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Son of a bitch! Why does it always fuckin' end up like this for me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Does that mean you've been pulling these kinds of dirty\r\n"
"tricks since your days in the yakuza?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "If that's the case, I'm not surprised they kicked you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Shut the fuck up! I don't need no sermon from you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I can't blame them for not wanting to put up with antics\r\n"
"like these."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "I wouldn't want to have anything to do with you, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Son of a bitch..."
msgstr "Figlio di puttana..."

msgctxt "212"
msgid "You can go cool off at the HLA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Zen-san! That's the guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "You Zen, then? Hand over the hostages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I never expected anybody to come barging in here... Well, whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Now that you're here, I guess there's no point in keeping these hostages "
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Hey, guys! Come keep this guy company while I deal with\r\n"
"these hostages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Show him just how hospitable we are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"If only you'd listened to me, you could've walked away\r\n"
"intact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "It's gonna take more than this to keep me back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"I said, you must be crazy if you think these weaklings have\r\n"
"what it takes to take me on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"I'll clear them all out before you so much as touch those\r\n"
"hostages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Hey, asshole! Who're you calling weak, huh!?"
msgstr ""

